		(uuid "5149196e-5956-406e-8c15-ab8337bf8680")
	)
	(text "J204: JST XH, 2 pin\n1 GND   2 switch\n\nStop switch:\nEAO 51-256.025, NC\ncontact, terminals 1, 2.\nClosed = run.\nPressed or unplugged:\nall bridges off (Hi-Z).\n\nNo stop switch: fit a\njumper plug on J204.\n\nDRV_OFF = PB5"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 115.57 104.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "632167da-33fe-4497-bf74-cbb02f2b469b")
	)
	(text "J203 IDLE, J207 RUN, J208 FAULT:\nJST XH, 2 pin, one header per LED\n1 LED anode (+)     2 GND\n\nLEDs: Lumex SSI-LXH312 (2 V),\nabout 8 mA each.\nIDLE = yellow (SSI-LXH312YD-150),\nRUN = green (SSI-LXH312GD-150),\nFAULT = red (SSI-LXH312ID-150).\nLED_IDLE = PC9, LED_RUN = PC8,\nLED_FAULT = PB9.\nOutput high = LED on."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100.33 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7c9d6aa6-3a03-467a-8c15-8f0545507bf7")
	)
	(text "Front Panel I/O"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3 3)
				(thickness 0.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "83e501fd-2140-4e2f-add9-e5e34bf01b44")
	)
	(text "DISABLE = 1 switches all three DRV8873S bridges off (Hi-Z). R204 pulls it up,\nthe closed stop switch holds it low through R205.\nThe MCU pin PB5 (DRV_OFF) can only add an OFF: D202 lets it push DISABLE high,\nand R104 is too weak to pull it low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 146.05 102.87 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "86ff1901-e6e7-452b-8b64-9b456ac6f5d7")
	)
	(text "SPARE I/O"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 146.05 44.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c5e5510c-c92f-4046-a548-ed61cccf1a23")
	)
	(text "DISABLE TRUTH TABLE (the stop switch always wins)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 146.05 97.79 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c7819477-c9c2-43e7-936c-f91aa08c08af")
	)
	(text "J205: JST XH, 4 pin\n1 +3V3\n2 not connected\n3 PB4\n4 GND\n\nPB4: TIM3_CH1, USART2_RX"
